          "content": "2026-10-23 — Mirrored to code at fa525618 (#904): no dot, neutral origin chips, relative age, no footer on one page; the detail redrawn as a request error (the job one showed params jobs never record), with the latest-occurrence note, Veces, a wrapping trace and a full-width delete.\n2026-10-23 — Split out of flows/settings.pen (kit and artboards carried as they were) so errors and usage are designed as flows of their own.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
